Hi Saskhi,

These are pretty straightforward analyses and you have at least 2 ways for this particular comparison:

1. Use "classic" edgeR and specify the groups you want to make comparisons between using the 'pair' argument of the exactTest() function.

2. Use "GLM" edgeR and define an appropriate contrast for your difference of interest.

They should, in fact, be very similar.

There are various examples in the user's guide:
http://www.bioconductor.org/packages/release/bioc/vignettes/edgeR/inst/doc/edgeRUsersGuide.pdf

Best, Mark


