Subject: [BioC] Is there any prejudice whether to use edgeR or DESeq for
 differential expression analysis for RNA Seq data
In-Reply-To: <CAHA9McO9j+E+0Bj8wYMbR4e2QhgFOiSHOW2JyqB4WxZ15hdwJg@mail.gmail.com>
