Hej!

You want to use the tag argument of the ScanBamParam object. Here is how I retrieve the BWA XA tags:

bam<- scanBam("my.bam",
               index="my.bam",
               param=ScanBamParam(
                 flag=scanBamFlag(isUnmappedQuery=FALSE),
                 what=c("rname","pos","qwidth"),
                 tag="XA"))[[1]]

Cheers,

Nico

